CMakeLists.txt: build only what openccu-lite installs

openccu-lite builds from OpenCCU-Base pruned to openccu-base-paths.txt:
without the WebUI (src/webui) and without the daemons openccu-lite does not
ship: hss_led (occulited drives the status LED), eq3configd (occulited
answers the discovery) and ssdpd (occulited announces the system),
openccu-lite tasks 329 and 335. Stage the device types and the homematic Tcl
package as before.

Upstream: Not applicable (openccu-lite only)

Signed-off-by: Sebastian Raff <hobbyquaker@gmail.com>

